-And, to list all the targets in the repo, run `bazel query @wget_src//...`.
+```sh
+bazel fetch @wget_src
+bazel query @wget_src//...
+```
+
+To build against a specific version:
+
+```starlark
+# BUILD.bazel
+cc_binary(
+    name = "my_tool",
+    srcs = ["main.c"],
+    data = ["@wget_src//1.24.5:files"],
